;;;; Annual 国务院办公厅 notices (国办发明电; 国发明电〔2015〕1号) on the 放假调休 of each year.
;;;; :WORKING = the 上班 Saturdays and Sundays. :TRANSFERS = the days of each 放假 window
;;;; that are no 全国年节及纪念日放假办法 第二条 day (those come from the rules of
;;;; china-holidays-calendar), named by kind:
;;;;   <festival>（补休）  the weekday 第六条 owes for a statutory day on a Saturday or Sunday
;;;;                      (in date order, the first weekday off after it; the 2008-2013
;;;;                      notices spell these moves out);
;;;;   <window>（调休）    any other weekday off, paid back by a 上班 day;
;;;;   <window>（休息日）  a Saturday or Sunday of the window;
;;;;   春节（延长假期）, the 2015-09-03 纪念日: the special days of an amendment.
;;;; A fourth element names the amending notice of that day.
;;;; :CONFIDENCE :PRIMARY = the notice text on www.gov.cn (2007-2027);
;;;; :SECONDARY = Xinhua dispatches / republications and zh.wikisource transcriptions
;;;; (2000-2006, :SOURCE-KIND says which). No 2000 春节 or 劳动节 text was found:
;;;; those years have the statute days only. Years after 2027 have no notice
;;;; (cn-provisional-year-p). Gold: data/tests/cn-holiday-gold.sexp (2007-2040) and
;;;; cn-secondary-holiday-gold.sexp (2000-2006), scripts/generate_asia_holiday_gold.py.

